= Evaluation <ch:evaluation>

This chapter asks three questions of the implementation. First (@sec:correctness-eval): what does the agreement theorem actually rule out, and what is left to behavioural testing? Second (@sec:cold-eval): what does cold elaboration cost on the two corpora the elaborator was built against, and where in the pipeline does the time go? Third (@sec:incremental-eval): under nine edit categories chosen to isolate distinct framework mechanisms, what does an incremental rebuild cost, and what does that cost reveal about the framework underneath?

